8
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:31.589
And yes, I have lived in Dubai for the past 11 years already.

9
00:00:32.559 --> 00:00:38.320
And my argument today is that the real evidence that the city is

10
00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:43.840
smart is when the residents of this city stop noticing it.

11
00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:46.550
This is what I'll be talking about with you today.

12
00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:53.520
As I said, I have lived in Dubai for the past 11 years, and

13
00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:58.320
honestly speaking, I have already stopped counting the different platforms

14
00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:04.630
I use, the different applications I use there. There are just so many, and

15
00:01:05.199 --> 00:01:10.720
