They have been operating since March this year.

27
00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:09.759
I have seen them. I have not used them yet,

28
00:02:09.759 --> 00:02:15.840
but probably I will soon, because the target of Dubai is to have one

29
00:02:15.840 --> 00:02:20.630
