30
00:02:22.239 --> 00:02:26.230
Some other impressive things, for example,

31
00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:32.400
close to the airport in Dubai, we have the first commercial

32
00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:36.950
vertiport for air taxis, which are some big drones.

33
00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:39.830
I haven't seen them yet, honestly.

34
00:02:40.319 --> 00:02:43.519
They are supposed to be launched by the end of this year.

35
00:02:43.519 --> 00:02:46.400
I'm not sure if I'll trust them, at least not in the beginning,

36
00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:52.400
