40
00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:11.509
passport or without showing your ticket for your flight.

41
00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:17.840
And I'm not sure if you know, but to tell you the truth,

42
00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:19.270
I didn't know this either.

43
00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:24.709
The metro in Dubai has been operating without drivers since 2009.

44
00:03:26.959 --> 00:03:30.400
Okay. But as a resident, maybe these things that I just showed you,

45
00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:33.509
they are very impressive for tourists coming to Dubai.

46
00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:36.400
People take pictures of them and so on.

47
00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:39.830
But as a resident, that's not what makes my life easier.

48
00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.319
There are other things that don't look so impressive,

49
00:03:44.319 --> 00:03:48.560
but actually this is what makes a real difference for me and for the

50
00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.080
other residents in Dubai.

51
00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:56.640
For example, not having a queue where I need to wait to pay my bills,

52
00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:03.200
to pay my fines, traffic fines, because it is very likely to get

53
00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:08.239
traffic fines in Dubai, unfortunately, or to renew my Emirates

54
00:04:08.239 --> 00:04:13.840
ID, to renew my visa, for example, and so on, because I can do

55
00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:18.400
this through one application, all of these services and many, many

56
00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:24.080
more. In addition, I don't need to do, as I mentioned already, this

57
00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:30.639
long drive across the city and take hours from my work, for example, or

58
00:04:30.639 --> 00:04:34.070
from my personal life to do some services.

59
00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:39.670
Just recently, to give you an example, I had to renew my

60
00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:46.160
registration of my car, and I did it in a few minutes, literally from

61
00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:52.160
