62
00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:56.230
card for my car at home just a few days later.

63
00:04:57.919 --> 00:05:01.670
Also, I don't keep any more paper documents,

64
00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:05.029
which is very convenient for me.

65
00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:09.589
However, of course, I need to keep electronic copies of everything.

66
00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:15.759
And maybe you don't know, but all government entities in

67
00:05:15.759 --> 00:05:17.029
Dubai, they accept

68
00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:22.870
only electronic documents and they also issue electronic documents.

69
00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:27.589
On top of that, I have one digital identity in Dubai,

70
00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:33.510
