71
00:05:33.919 --> 00:05:36.150
I don't need to remember different passwords,

72
00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:41.189
different usernames, and I log in with my fingerprint.

73
00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:48.320
This is called UAE Pass. Attestation of documents also happens fully

74
00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:53.440
online. For example, two years ago I had to attest the school

75
00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:54.950
documents of my daughter,

76
00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:58.790
and I did this completely online.

77
00:05:59.919 --> 00:06:04.800
Okay, I'm very short of time, it looks like. Just some numbers, very

78
00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:11.520
briefly: the Dubai government set an objective in 2018,

79
00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:16.319
by the way, for three years, to remove all paper from the government

80
00:06:16.319 --> 00:06:18.960
entities, and they accomplished it.

81
00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:23.910
By the way, I'll skip the numbers in the interest of time.

82
00:06:24.479 --> 00:06:30.080
So my argument here is that all this is not because of the

83
00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:34.639
technologies. I mean, of course technologies are important, but

84
00:06:34.639 --> 00:06:38.960
technologies are available for other cities also, right, and other

85
00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:43.360
governments, sorry, not only in Dubai or the UAE in

86
00:06:43.360 --> 00:06:47.589
general. So my argument is

87
00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:55.039
that the difference is the decision taken, and the decision

88
00:06:55.039 --> 00:07:02.160
at scale being applied to all institutions with the same

89
00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:05.589
deadline and being available to the public.

90
00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:10.639
I'll skip this. Okay, this is more important actually.

91
00:07:10.639 --> 00:07:17.360
It is what changes in practice for the residents. That's

92
00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:24.000
the important part. So what I have saved due to this is

93
00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:30.560
time, because now this time spent driving across town

94
00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:33.589
I have for myself, my work, my family.

95
00:07:35.039 --> 00:07:40.639
Also, predictability is another benefit I have. Now I know exactly how

96
00:07:40.639 --> 00:07:44.309
much time it will take me for a particular service,

97
00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:48.710
and it takes exactly that long, believe me.

98
00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:54.240
On the other hand, something really important for me, when I was

99
00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:59.840
making the parallel with when I used to live in Bulgaria, is that for me the

100
00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:03.110
government is no longer a place where I go.

101
00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:06.070
It is now a service I use.

102
00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:12.240
Okay. Of course, on the other side there is always some

103
00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:15.840
inconvenience, you know, wherever there is light there is shadow,

104
00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:21.280
they say. Some inconvenience is that we are very much reliant on

105
00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:27.039
technology, which has risks of course, and I'll be very short, and also

106
00:08:27.039 --> 00:08:33.680
that I need to trust with my digital identity, and as you can

107
00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:38.000
understand, since everything is digital, everything leaves some record

108
00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.029
